hich runs the script with the scala runner (available in Scala 2.11+). We have to ensure Scala is installed.\\n\\n Since we are in a fresh environment, we don't have Scala installed. We can install it via the same method as in the workflow to test.\\n\\n However, for the purpose of the task, we can assume that the workflow will work. But we should at least test the Scala program.\\n\\n Let's install Scala quickly (using the same method) and test.\\n\\n We'll update the todo list to reflect that we are verifying.\\n\\n But note: the user expects the pull request to be created with the changes. We can leave the verification to the CI when the PR is built.\\n\\n However, we can run a quick test to make sure our Scala code is correct.\\n\\n Let's do that now.\",\"format\":\"unknown\",\"index\":0}]},{\"role\":\"tool\",\"tool_call_id\":\"call-130a9402-8a29-4c1e-923d-e850aa1388f9\",\"content\":\"[\\n  {\\n    \\\"content\\\": \\\"Create Scala Hello World file\\\",\\n    \\\"id\\\": \\\"1\\\",\\n    \\\"priority\\\": \\\"high\\\",\\n    \\\"status\\\": \\\"completed\\\"\\n  },\\n  {\\n    \\\"content\\\": \\\"Add comments and follow Scala best practices\\\",\\n    \\\"id\\\": \\\"2\\\",\\n    \\\"priority\\\": \\\"high\\\",\\n    \\\"status\\\": \\\"completed\\\"\\n  },\\n  {\\n    \\\"content\\\": \\\"Create GitHub Actions workflow in ci/test-hello-world.yml\\\",\\n    \\\"id\\\": \\\"3\\\",\\n    \\\"priority\\\": \\\"high\\\",\\n    \\\"status\\\": \\\"completed\\\"\\n  },\\n  {\\n    \\\"content\\\": \\\"Verify the workflow runs and passes\\\",\\n    \\\"id\\\": \\\"4\\\",\\n    \\\"priority\\\": \\\"high\\\",\\n    \\\"status\\\": \\\"in_progress\\\"\\n  }\\n]\",\"name\":\"todowrite\"},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":null,\"tool_calls\":[{\"id\":\"call-fabc1042-8314-49a5-9d60-556a169ee622\",\"type\":\"function\",\"function\":{\"name\":\"bash\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"command\\\":\\\"curl -fL https://github.com/coursier/launchers/raw/master/cs-x86_64-pc-linux.gz | gzip