[2026-10-16T20:12:24.389Z] [INFO]             "text": "Great! Now we have Java. Let's install coursier and then Scala.\n\n We'll follow the same steps as in the workflow but non-interactively.\n\n We can use:\n\n   curl -fL https://github.com/coursier/launchers/raw/master/cs-x86_64-pc-linux.gz | gzip -d > cs\n   chmod +x cs\n   ./cs setup -y   # to assume yes for JVM installation\n\n But note: the coursier setup might try to install a JVM, but we already have one. We can tell it to use the existing JVM.\n\n Alternatively, we can just use the cs to get Scala.\n\n Let's do:\n\n   ./cs install scala\n\n This will install Scala and put it in the coursier bin directory.\n\n Let's try.",
